---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: QualityHypothesis[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for planCorrection. Select approved containment and corrective actions, assign qualified owners, and specify verification criteria before implementation. Distinguish immediate correction of defective units from prevention of recurrence and preserve unaffected production where evidence supports it. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
